   '# Playwright - Complete Technology Guide                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## What is Playwright?                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Playwright** is a modern end-to-end testing framework for web applications created by Microsoft. It''s an all-in-one solution that consolidates:                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - **Test runner**                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 - **Assertions library**                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 - **Test isolation**                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 - **Parallelization**                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 - **Browser automation**                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 - **Debugging tools**                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 All within a single package, eliminating the need for multiple separate tools.                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Why Use Playwright?                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Key Advantages                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Multi-browser Support**                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - Chromium, WebKit (Safari), Firefox                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 - Cross-platform: Windows, Linux, macOS                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 - Mobile emulation: Android Chrome, iOS Safari                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **All-in-One Solution**                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 - No need to install separate test runners, assertion libraries, or parallel execution tools                                                                                                                                +
 - Integrated debugging with UI Mode                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - Built-in code generation (Codegen)                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Modern Testing Approach**                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 - Auto-waiting for elements (no manual `sleep()`)                                                                                                                                                                           +
 - Automatic retries and actionability checks                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - Test isolation (each test gets fresh browser context)                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Developer Experience**                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 - Time-travel debugging                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 - Watch mode with live test visualization                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 - Rich HTML reports with filtering                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 - Screenshot/video capture on failures                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **CI/CD Ready**                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 - Runs headless in CI environments                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 - GitHub Actions workflow included                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 - Sharding support for distributed testing                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Installation & Setup                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Quick Start                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 # Initialize new Playwright project                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 npm init playwright@latest                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Or add to existing project                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 npm install -D @playwright/test                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 npx playwright install                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### What Gets Created                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 my-project/                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 ├── playwright.config.ts    # Main configuration                                                                                                                                                                            +
 ├── tests/                  # Your test files                                                                                                                                                                               +
 │   └── example.spec.ts                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 ├── tests-examples/         # Example patterns                                                                                                                                                                              +
 └── .github/                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     └── workflows/                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
         └── playwright.yml  # CI configuration (optional)                                                                                                                                                                   +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### System Requirements                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - **Node.js**: v20.x, v22.x, or v24.x                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 - **OS**: Windows 11+, macOS 14+, Ubuntu 22.04/24.04, Debian 12/13                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Core Concepts                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. Browser Architecture                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 Playwright                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 ├── Browser (Chromium/Firefox/WebKit)                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 │   ├── BrowserContext (isolated session)                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 │   │   ├── Page (tab/window)                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 │   │   │   ├── Frame (iframe content)                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 │   │   │   └── Locators (element selectors)                                                                                                                                                                                +
 │   │   └── Page                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 │   └── BrowserContext                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. Test Isolation                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Critical Concept**: Every test gets a fresh browser context.                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 test(''test 1'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   // Fresh browser context                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   // No cookies, storage, or cache from other tests                                                                                                                                                                         +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test(''test 2'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   // Completely new browser context                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   // Cannot access data from test 1                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Benefits:                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 - No test pollution                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - True parallelization                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 - Reproducible results                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. Auto-Waiting                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Playwright automatically waits for elements to be **actionable** before performing actions:                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Element is visible                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 - Element is stable (not animating)                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - Element receives events                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 - Element is enabled (not disabled)                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // No manual waits needed!                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 await page.getByRole(''button'').click(); // Waits until button is clickable                                                                                                                                                +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Writing Tests                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Basic Test Structure                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test(''basic test example'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                          +
   // 1. Navigate                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   await page.goto(''https://playwright.dev/'');                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // 2. Perform actions                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   await page.getByRole(''link'', { name: ''Get started'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // 3. Assert expectations                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   await expect(page).toHaveTitle(/Getting Started/);                                                                                                                                                                        +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Test Organization                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test.describe(''Feature: User Authentication'', () => {                                                                                                                                                                     +
   // Runs before each test in this describe block                                                                                                                                                                           +
   test.beforeEach(async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     await page.goto(''https://example.com/login'');                                                                                                                                                                         +
   });                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   test(''should login with valid credentials'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                       +
     await page.getByLabel(''Username'').fill(''user@example.com'');                                                                                                                                                         +
     await page.getByLabel(''Password'').fill(''password123'');                                                                                                                                                              +
     await page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Sign in'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     await expect(page).toHaveURL(/dashboard/);                                                                                                                                                                              +
   });                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   test(''should show error with invalid credentials'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                +
     await page.getByLabel(''Username'').fill(''wrong@example.com'');                                                                                                                                                        +
     await page.getByLabel(''Password'').fill(''wrong'');                                                                                                                                                                    +
     await page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Sign in'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     await expect(page.getByText(''Invalid credentials'')).toBeVisible();                                                                                                                                                    +
   });                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Common Actions                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Navigation                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 await page.goto(''https://example.com'');                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 await page.goBack();                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 await page.reload();                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Clicking                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 await page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Submit'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                             +
 await page.getByText(''Click me'').dblclick();                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Text input                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 await page.getByLabel(''Email'').fill(''user@example.com'');                                                                                                                                                                +
 await page.getByPlaceholder(''Search...'').type(''playwright'');                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Checkboxes & Radio buttons                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 await page.getByLabel(''Accept terms'').check();                                                                                                                                                                            +
 await page.getByLabel(''Decline'').uncheck();                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Dropdowns                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 await page.getByLabel(''Country'').selectOption(''USA'');                                                                                                                                                                   +
 await page.getByLabel(''Color'').selectOption({ label: ''Blue'' });                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Keyboard                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 await page.getByRole(''textbox'').press(''Enter'');                                                                                                                                                                         +
 await page.keyboard.press(''Control+A'');                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // File upload                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 await page.getByLabel(''Upload'').setInputFiles(''path/to/file.pdf'');                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Hover                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 await page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Menu'' }).hover();                                                                                                                                                               +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Assertions                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Page assertions                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 await expect(page).toHaveTitle(/Playwright/);                                                                                                                                                                               +
 await expect(page).toHaveURL(''https://example.com/dashboard'');                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Element visibility                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 await expect(page.getByText(''Welcome'')).toBeVisible();                                                                                                                                                                    +
 await expect(page.getByText(''Loading'')).toBeHidden();                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Text content                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 await expect(page.getByRole(''heading'')).toHaveText(''Dashboard'');                                                                                                                                                        +
 await expect(page.getByTestId(''status'')).toContainText(''Success'');                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Attributes                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 await expect(page.getByRole(''button'')).toBeEnabled();                                                                                                                                                                     +
 await expect(page.getByRole(''button'')).toBeDisabled();                                                                                                                                                                    +
 await expect(page.locator(''img'')).toHaveAttribute(''src'', /logo.png/);                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Count                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 await expect(page.getByRole(''listitem'')).toHaveCount(5);                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Values (for inputs)                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 await expect(page.getByLabel(''Username'')).toHaveValue(''john@example.com'');                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Locators - The Right Way                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Priority Order (Use in This Order!)                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **🥇 RECOMMENDED - User-facing locators:**                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // 1. Role (BEST for interactive elements)                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 await page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Sign in'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                            +
 await page.getByRole(''link'', { name: ''Home'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                                 +
 await page.getByRole(''textbox'', { name: ''Email'' }).fill(''test@example.com'');                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Common roles: button, link, textbox, checkbox, radio, heading, listitem, etc.                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 2. Label (BEST for form fields)                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 await page.getByLabel(''Email address'').fill(''user@example.com'');                                                                                                                                                        +
 await page.getByLabel(''Password'').fill(''secret'');                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 3. Placeholder                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 await page.getByPlaceholder(''Enter your email...'').fill(''test@example.com'');                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 4. Text (BEST for non-interactive elements)                                                                                                                                                                              +
 await expect(page.getByText(''Welcome back!'')).toBeVisible();                                                                                                                                                              +
 await expect(page.getByText(/successfully/i)).toBeVisible(); // regex                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 5. Alt text (for images)                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 await expect(page.getByAltText(''Company logo'')).toBeVisible();                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 6. Title attribute                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 await page.getByTitle(''Close dialog'').click();                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 7. Test ID (resilient fallback)                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 await page.getByTestId(''submit-button'').click();                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **❌ NOT RECOMMENDED - Fragile selectors:**                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // DON''T use CSS selectors tied to DOM structure                                                                                                                                                                           +
 await page.locator(''#app > div > div.header > button:nth-child(3)'').click();                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // DON''T use XPath                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 await page.locator(''//div[@id="app"]//button[3]'').click();                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // These break when DOM structure changes!                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Why This Matters                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Role-based locators:**                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 - ✅ Match how users perceive the page                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 - ✅ Follow W3C ARIA accessibility standards                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - ✅ Resilient to DOM changes                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 - ✅ Improve accessibility awareness                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **CSS/XPath selectors:**                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 - ❌ Break when structure changes                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 - ❌ Don''t reflect user experience                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - ❌ Hard to maintain                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Advanced Locator Techniques                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Filtering                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 await page                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   .getByRole(''listitem'')                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   .filter({ hasText: ''Product 2'' })                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   .getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Add to cart'' })                                                                                                                                                                         +
   .click();                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Combining locators (AND)                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 await page                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   .getByRole(''button'')                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   .and(page.getByTitle(''Subscribe''))                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .click();                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Alternative matching (OR)                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 await page                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   .getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Sign in'' })                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .or(page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Log in'' }))                                                                                                                                                                     +
   .click();                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Chaining                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 await page                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   .getByRole(''navigation'')                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   .getByRole(''link'', { name: ''About'' })                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   .click();                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Position (use sparingly!)                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 await page.getByRole(''listitem'').first().click();                                                                                                                                                                         +
 await page.getByRole(''listitem'').last().click();                                                                                                                                                                          +
 await page.getByRole(''listitem'').nth(2).click();                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Auto-Waiting Behavior                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Playwright automatically waits for elements to be actionable                                                                                                                                                             +
 await page.getByRole(''button'').click();                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 // Waits for:                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // - Element exists in DOM                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 // - Element is visible                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 // - Element is stable (not animating)                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 // - Element can receive events                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // - Element is enabled                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // No need for manual waits!                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 // ❌ Don''t do this:                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 await page.waitForTimeout(1000);                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 await page.getByRole(''button'').click();                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Do this:                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 await page.getByRole(''button'').click(); // Auto-waits!                                                                                                                                                                    +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Configuration                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Basic Configuration (`playwright.config.ts`)                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { defineConfig, devices } from ''@playwright/test'';                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 export default defineConfig({                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   // Test directory                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   testDir: ''./tests'',                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Parallel execution                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   fullyParallel: true,                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Retry failed tests                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   retries: process.env.CI ? 2 : 0,                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Concurrent workers                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   workers: process.env.CI ? 1 : undefined,                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Test timeout                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   timeout: 30 * 1000, // 30 seconds                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Expect timeout (for assertions)                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   expect: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     timeout: 5000 // 5 seconds                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   },                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Reporter                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   reporter: ''html'',                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Global settings for all tests                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   use: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     // Base URL                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     baseURL: ''http://localhost:3000'',                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     // Collect trace on first retry                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     trace: ''on-first-retry'',                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     // Screenshot on failure                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     screenshot: ''only-on-failure'',                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     // Video recording                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     video: ''retain-on-failure'',                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   },                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Browser projects                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   projects: [                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       name: ''chromium'',                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
       use: { ...devices[''Desktop Chrome''] },                                                                                                                                                                              +
     },                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       name: ''firefox'',                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
       use: { ...devices[''Desktop Firefox''] },                                                                                                                                                                             +
     },                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       name: ''webkit'',                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
       use: { ...devices[''Desktop Safari''] },                                                                                                                                                                              +
     },                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     // Mobile emulation                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       name: ''Mobile Chrome'',                                                                                                                                                                                              +
       use: { ...devices[''Pixel 5''] },                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     },                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       name: ''Mobile Safari'',                                                                                                                                                                                              +
       use: { ...devices[''iPhone 12''] },                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     },                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   ],                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Dev server                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   webServer: {                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     command: ''npm run dev'',                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     url: ''http://localhost:3000'',                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     reuseExistingServer: !process.env.CI,                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   },                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Important Configuration Options                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 | Option | Description | Example |                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 |--------|-------------|---------|                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 | `testDir` | Test files location | `''./tests''` |                                                                                                                                                                         +
 | `fullyParallel` | Run all tests in parallel | `true` |                                                                                                                                                                    +
 | `workers` | Max concurrent workers | `4` or `''50%''` |                                                                                                                                                                   +
 | `retries` | Retry failed tests | `2` |                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 | `timeout` | Test timeout | `30000` (30s) |                                                                                                                                                                                +
 | `use.baseURL` | Default navigation URL | `''http://localhost:3000''` |                                                                                                                                                    +
 | `use.trace` | When to capture traces | `''on-first-retry''` |                                                                                                                                                             +
 | `use.screenshot` | Screenshot capture | `''only-on-failure''` |                                                                                                                                                           +
 | `reporter` | Test output format | `''html''`, `''list''`, `''json''` |                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Running Tests                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 # Run all tests                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 npx playwright test                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Run specific file                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 npx playwright test tests/login.spec.ts                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Run in headed mode (see browser)                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 npx playwright test --headed                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Run specific browser                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 npx playwright test --project=chromium                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Debug mode                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 npx playwright test --debug                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # UI Mode (interactive)                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 npx playwright test --ui                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Show HTML report                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 npx playwright show-report                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## API Architecture                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Main Classes                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { chromium, firefox, webkit } from ''@playwright/test'';                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 1. Browser                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 const browser = await chromium.launch();                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 2. BrowserContext (isolated session)                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 const context = await browser.newContext();                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 3. Page                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 const page = await context.newPage();                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 4. Navigate and interact                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 await page.goto(''https://example.com'');                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // 5. Cleanup                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 await context.close();                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 await browser.close();                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Browser Context Benefits                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Each context is isolated                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 const context1 = await browser.newContext();                                                                                                                                                                                +
 const context2 = await browser.newContext();                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Different storage, cookies, sessions                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 // Perfect for testing multiple users simultaneously                                                                                                                                                                        +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Device Emulation                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { devices } from ''@playwright/test'';                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const iPhone = devices[''iPhone 12''];                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 const context = await browser.newContext({                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   ...iPhone,                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   locale: ''en-US'',                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   geolocation: { longitude: 12.492507, latitude: 41.889938 },                                                                                                                                                               +
   permissions: [''geolocation''],                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Error Handling                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test(''handles errors'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                              +
   try {                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     await page.goto(''https://example.com'');                                                                                                                                                                               +
     await page.getByRole(''button'').click({ timeout: 5000 });                                                                                                                                                              +
   } catch (error) {                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     if (error.name === ''TimeoutError'') {                                                                                                                                                                                  +
       console.log(''Element not found within timeout'');                                                                                                                                                                    +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     throw error; // Re-throw to fail the test                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Best Practices                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. Use User-Facing Locators                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ GOOD - reflects user experience                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 await page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Submit'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                             +
 await page.getByLabel(''Email'').fill(''test@example.com'');                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ BAD - fragile CSS selectors                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 await page.locator(''#app div.form button.submit'').click();                                                                                                                                                                +
 await page.locator(''input[type="email"]'').fill(''test@example.com'');                                                                                                                                                     +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. Leverage Auto-Waiting                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ GOOD - auto-waits for actionability                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 await page.getByRole(''button'').click();                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ BAD - manual waits are unreliable                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 await page.waitForTimeout(1000);                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 await page.locator(''button'').click();                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. Use Async Assertions                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ GOOD - waits until condition is true                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 await expect(page.getByText(''Success'')).toBeVisible();                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ BAD - might fail due to timing                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 expect(await page.getByText(''Success'').isVisible()).toBe(true);                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 4. Organize with Page Object Model                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // pages/LoginPage.ts                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 export class LoginPage {                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   constructor(private page: Page) {}                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   async login(email: string, password: string) {                                                                                                                                                                            +
     await this.page.getByLabel(''Email'').fill(email);                                                                                                                                                                      +
     await this.page.getByLabel(''Password'').fill(password);                                                                                                                                                                +
     await this.page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Sign in'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                   +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   async expectErrorMessage(message: string) {                                                                                                                                                                               +
     await expect(this.page.getByText(message)).toBeVisible();                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // tests/login.spec.ts                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 import { LoginPage } from ''../pages/LoginPage'';                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test(''login test'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   const loginPage = new LoginPage(page);                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   await page.goto(''/login'');                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   await loginPage.login(''user@example.com'', ''password'');                                                                                                                                                                +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 5. Test Isolation                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ GOOD - each test is independent                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 test(''test 1'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   await page.goto(''/'');                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   // Test logic                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test(''test 2'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   await page.goto(''/'');                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   // Test logic - fresh context                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ BAD - tests depend on each other                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 let sharedPage;                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test.beforeAll(async ({ browser }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   sharedPage = await browser.newPage();                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test(''test 1'', async () => {                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   await sharedPage.goto(''/step1'');                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test(''test 2'', async () => {                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   // Depends on test 1''s state!                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   await sharedPage.goto(''/step2'');                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 6. Use baseURL                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // playwright.config.ts                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 export default defineConfig({                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   use: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     baseURL: ''http://localhost:3000'',                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   },                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // tests/example.spec.ts                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 test(''navigation test'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ GOOD - uses baseURL                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   await page.goto(''/dashboard'');                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ❌ BAD - hardcoded full URL                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   await page.goto(''http://localhost:3000/dashboard'');                                                                                                                                                                     +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Important Things to Know                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. Strictness Mode                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Playwright enforces single-element matches by default:                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // If multiple buttons exist, this throws an error                                                                                                                                                                          +
 await page.getByRole(''button'').click();                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 // Error: strict mode violation: locator(''button'') resolved to 3 elements                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Solution: be more specific                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 await page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Submit'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. Timeouts                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Different timeout types:                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Test timeout (default: 30s)                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 test(''slow test'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   test.setTimeout(60000); // 60 seconds for this test                                                                                                                                                                       +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Action timeout                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 await page.getByRole(''button'').click({ timeout: 10000 });                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Assertion timeout                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 await expect(page.getByText(''Done'')).toBeVisible({ timeout: 15000 });                                                                                                                                                     +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. Network Interception                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 test(''mock API response'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                           +
   // Intercept and modify network requests                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   await page.route(''**/api/users'', route => {                                                                                                                                                                             +
     route.fulfill({                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       status: 200,                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       body: JSON.stringify([{ id: 1, name: ''Test User'' }])                                                                                                                                                                +
     });                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   });                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   await page.goto(''/users'');                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 4. Screenshots & Videos                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Screenshot                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 await page.screenshot({ path: ''screenshot.png'' });                                                                                                                                                                        +
 await page.screenshot({ path: ''full-page.png'', fullPage: true });                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Element screenshot                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 await page.getByRole(''banner'').screenshot({ path: ''header.png'' });                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Videos are automatically recorded if configured                                                                                                                                                                          +
 // See trace files with:                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 // npx playwright show-trace trace.zip                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 5. Debugging Tools                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 # UI Mode (best for development)                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 npx playwright test --ui                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Debug mode (step through tests)                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 npx playwright test --debug                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Headed mode (see browser)                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 npx playwright test --headed                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Codegen (generate tests by recording)                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 npx playwright codegen https://example.com                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 6. API Testing (Bonus!)                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Playwright can test APIs without a browser:                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test(''API test'', async ({ request }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   const response = await request.get(''https://api.example.com/users'');                                                                                                                                                    +
   expect(response.ok()).toBeTruthy();                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   expect(response.status()).toBe(200);                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   const data = await response.json();                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   expect(data).toHaveLength(10);                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 7. Mobile Testing                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { test, devices } from ''@playwright/test'';                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test.use({                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   ...devices[''iPhone 12''],                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test(''mobile test'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   // Runs with iPhone 12 viewport and user agent                                                                                                                                                                            +
   await page.goto(''/'');                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 8. Common Pitfalls to Avoid                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ❌ **Don''t use CSS selectors**                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Bad                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 await page.locator(''.btn-primary'').click();                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Good                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 await page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Submit'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ❌ **Don''t use manual waits**                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Bad                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 await page.waitForTimeout(3000);                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Good                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 await expect(page.getByText(''Loaded'')).toBeVisible();                                                                                                                                                                     +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ❌ **Don''t share state between tests**                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Bad                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 let globalPage;                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test.beforeAll(async ({ browser }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   globalPage = await browser.newPage();                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Good - use fixtures                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 test(''test'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   // Fresh page for each test                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Quick Reference Cheat Sheet                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Essential Commands                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 # Install                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 npm init playwright@latest                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Run tests                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 npx playwright test                    # All tests                                                                                                                                                                          +
 npx playwright test file.spec.ts       # Specific file                                                                                                                                                                      +
 npx playwright test --headed           # See browser                                                                                                                                                                        +
 npx playwright test --ui               # UI Mode                                                                                                                                                                            +
 npx playwright test --debug            # Debug mode                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Reports                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 npx playwright show-report             # View HTML report                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Code generation                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 npx playwright codegen example.com     # Record tests                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Install browsers                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 npx playwright install                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Essential Test Pattern                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { test, expect } from ''@playwright/test'';                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 test(''feature name'', async ({ page }) => {                                                                                                                                                                                +
   // Navigate                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   await page.goto(''/'');                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Interact                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   await page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Click me'' }).click();                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Assert                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   await expect(page.getByText(''Success'')).toBeVisible();                                                                                                                                                                  +
 });                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Essential Locators                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 page.getByRole(''button'', { name: ''Submit'' })  // Interactive elements                                                                                                                                                   +
 page.getByLabel(''Email'')                      // Form fields                                                                                                                                                              +
 page.getByText(''Welcome'')                     // Text content                                                                                                                                                             +
 page.getByPlaceholder(''Search...'')            // Input placeholders                                                                                                                                                       +
 page.getByTestId(''submit-btn'')                // Test IDs                                                                                                                                                                 +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Essential Assertions                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 await expect(page).toHaveTitle(/Expected/);                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 await expect(page).toHaveURL(/dashboard/);                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 await expect(locator).toBeVisible();                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 await expect(locator).toHaveText(''Expected'');                                                                                                                                                                             +
 await expect(locator).toBeEnabled();                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 await expect(locator).toHaveCount(5);                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Summary                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Playwright is a comprehensive end-to-end testing framework that simplifies web automation with:                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **All-in-one testing solution** (no separate tools needed)                                                                                                                                                               +
 ✅ **Auto-waiting and actionability checks** (reliable tests)                                                                                                                                                               +
 ✅ **Multi-browser and mobile support** (comprehensive coverage)                                                                                                                                                            +
 ✅ **Excellent debugging tools** (UI Mode, trace viewer)                                                                                                                                                                    +
 ✅ **Test isolation** (no flaky tests from shared state)                                                                                                                                                                    +
 ✅ **User-centric locators** (accessible, maintainable tests)                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Remember**: Focus on user-facing locators (role, label, text), leverage auto-waiting, maintain test isolation, and use the powerful debugging tools. Avoid CSS selectors and manual waits.                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Start simple, grow as needed** - Playwright scales from basic smoke tests to comprehensive E2E suites.                                                                                                                    +
