 ## What is Supabase?                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Supabase** is an open-source Backend-as-a-Service (BaaS) platform built on PostgreSQL. It positions itself as **"Firebase''s open-source alternative"** but with the power and flexibility of a full relational database. +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Key Characteristics                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - **Open Source**: Full source code available, self-hosting option                                                                                                                                                          +
 - **PostgreSQL Foundation**: Built on one of the world''s most stable and advanced databases                                                                                                                                +
 - **All-in-One Platform**: Database, Auth, Storage, Realtime, Functions in one package                                                                                                                                      +
 - **Developer-First**: Comprehensive APIs, SDKs, and documentation                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Why Use Supabase?                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Advantages                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Full PostgreSQL Database**                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Not a NoSQL abstraction - real Postgres with full SQL access                                                                                                                                                              +
 - Mature, stable, production-ready RDBMS                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 - Advanced features: triggers, functions, extensions, views                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Integrated Backend Stack**                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - No need to configure separate services for auth, storage, database                                                                                                                                                        +
 - Built-in Row Level Security (RLS) for fine-grained permissions                                                                                                                                                            +
 - Real-time subscriptions out of the box                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Open Source & Portable**                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 - Self-host on your infrastructure if needed                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - No vendor lock-in                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - Transparent codebase                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Developer Experience**                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 - Type-safe client libraries (TypeScript support)                                                                                                                                                                           +
 - Auto-generated REST APIs                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 - Spreadsheet-like table editor                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - SQL editor with saved queries                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Scalable & Global**                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 - CDN with 285+ cities for file delivery                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 - Auto-scaling database                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 - Built-in backups                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Cost-Effective**                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 - Generous free tier                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 - Transparent pricing                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 - Pay for what you use                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### When to Use Supabase                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Building web or mobile apps requiring backend infrastructure                                                                                                                                                              +
 - Projects needing real-time features (chat, collaboration, live updates)                                                                                                                                                   +
 - Applications with complex permission requirements (RLS)                                                                                                                                                                   +
 - Migrating from Firebase to a more flexible solution                                                                                                                                                                       +
 - Need for both structured (SQL) and unstructured (JSON) data                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Core Products & Features                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Supabase provides five main products:                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. **Database** 📊                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 - Managed PostgreSQL with full access                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 - Auto-generated REST APIs                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 - Built-in backups                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 - PostgreSQL extensions support                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Realtime functionality                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. **Authentication** 🔐                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - Email/password authentication                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Passwordless (magic links, OTP)                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 - OAuth providers (20+: Google, GitHub, Apple, etc.)                                                                                                                                                                        +
 - Phone/SMS authentication                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 - Web3 (Ethereum, Solana)                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 - Enterprise SSO                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 - Multi-factor authentication (MFA)                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. **Storage** 📦                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 - File upload and management                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - S3-compatible API                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - Global CDN (285+ cities)                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 - Image optimization and transformation                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 - Resumable uploads (TUS protocol)                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 - Access control with RLS policies                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 4. **Realtime** ⚡                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 - Database change subscriptions                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Broadcast messages across clients                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - Presence tracking                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - WebSocket-based                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 5. **Edge Functions** 🚀                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - Serverless functions                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 - Distributed globally                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 - Write in TypeScript/JavaScript                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 - Run on the edge                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Additional Features                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - **AI & Vectors**: Embeddings and ML support (pgvector)                                                                                                                                                                    +
 - **Cron**: Scheduled jobs                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 - **Message Queues**: Async processing                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Getting Started                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. Create a Project                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 # Option A: Use Dashboard                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 # Visit https://supabase.com/dashboard                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 # Click "New Project"                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Option B: Use CLI                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 npm install -g supabase                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 supabase init                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 supabase start                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. Install Client Library                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 npm install @supabase/supabase-js                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. Initialize Client                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // lib/supabase.ts                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 import { createClient } from ''@supabase/supabase-js''                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const supabaseUrl = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL!                                                                                                                                                                   +
 const supabaseKey = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY!                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 export const supabase = createClient(supabaseUrl, supabaseKey)                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 4. Environment Variables                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Create `.env.local`:                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```env                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co                                                                                                                                                                   +
 NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 5. First Query                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''todos'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 if (error) console.error(''Error:'', error)                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 else console.log(''Data:'', data)                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Database - PostgreSQL                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Table Creation                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Via Dashboard:**                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 1. Go to Table Editor                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 2. Click "New Table"                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 3. Define columns and data types                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 4. Set primary key                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 5. Configure RLS policies                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Via SQL:**                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- Create table                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 create table todos (                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   id bigint generated always as identity primary key,                                                                                                                                                                       +
   user_id uuid references auth.users(id) on delete cascade,                                                                                                                                                                 +
   title text not null,                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   completed boolean default false,                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   created_at timestamp with time zone default now()                                                                                                                                                                         +
 );                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Enable Row Level Security                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 alter table todos enable row level security;                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Create policy (users can only see their own todos)                                                                                                                                                                       +
 create policy "Users can view their own todos"                                                                                                                                                                              +
   on todos for select                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   using (auth.uid() = user_id);                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Common Data Types                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 | Type | Description | Example |                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 |------|-------------|---------|                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 | `bigint` | Large integer | `id bigint` |                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 | `text` | Text (unlimited) | `title text` |                                                                                                                                                                                +
 | `varchar(n)` | Text (max n chars) | `name varchar(255)` |                                                                                                                                                                 +
 | `boolean` | True/false | `completed boolean` |                                                                                                                                                                            +
 | `uuid` | Unique identifier | `user_id uuid` |                                                                                                                                                                             +
 | `timestamp` | Date and time | `created_at timestamp` |                                                                                                                                                                    +
 | `json` / `jsonb` | JSON data | `metadata jsonb` |                                                                                                                                                                         +
 | `integer[]` | Array | `tags integer[]` |                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Primary Keys                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Always create a primary key:**                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- Auto-incrementing ID (recommended)                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 id bigint generated always as identity primary key                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- UUID (for distributed systems)                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 id uuid default gen_random_uuid() primary key                                                                                                                                                                               +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Foreign Keys & Relationships                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- One-to-Many: User has many posts                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 create table posts (                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   id bigint generated always as identity primary key,                                                                                                                                                                       +
   user_id uuid references auth.users(id) on delete cascade,                                                                                                                                                                 +
   title text,                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   content text                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 );                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Many-to-Many: Posts have many tags, tags have many posts                                                                                                                                                                 +
 create table post_tags (                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   post_id bigint references posts(id) on delete cascade,                                                                                                                                                                    +
   tag_id bigint references tags(id) on delete cascade,                                                                                                                                                                      +
   primary key (post_id, tag_id)                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 );                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Row Level Security (RLS)                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Critical for security** - RLS ensures users can only access their own data:                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- Enable RLS                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 alter table posts enable row level security;                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Policy: Users can read their own posts                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 create policy "Users can view own posts"                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   on posts for select                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   using (auth.uid() = user_id);                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Policy: Users can insert their own posts                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 create policy "Users can create posts"                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   on posts for insert                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   with check (auth.uid() = user_id);                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Policy: Users can update their own posts                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 create policy "Users can update own posts"                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   on posts for update                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   using (auth.uid() = user_id);                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Policy: Users can delete their own posts                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 create policy "Users can delete own posts"                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   on posts for delete                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   using (auth.uid() = user_id);                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Naming Conventions                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Best Practices:**                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - Use `lowercase_with_underscores` (snake_case)                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Plural table names: `users`, `posts`, `comments`                                                                                                                                                                          +
 - Singular column names: `user_id`, `title`, `created_at`                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- ✅ GOOD                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 create table user_profiles (                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   id bigint,                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   first_name text,                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   last_name text                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 );                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- ❌ BAD                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 create table UserProfiles (                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   ID bigint,                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   FirstName text,                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   LastName text                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 );                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Schemas                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Organize tables into schemas for security:                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- Create private schema (hidden from auto-generated APIs)                                                                                                                                                                  +
 create schema private;                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Create table in private schema                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 create table private.salaries (                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   id bigint generated always as identity primary key,                                                                                                                                                                       +
   employee_id uuid,                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   salary numeric                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 );                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Public schema (default, exposed via API)                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 create table public.profiles (                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   id uuid primary key,                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   username text                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 );                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Views                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Create reusable queries without storing data:                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- Regular view (computed on query)                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 create view user_post_counts as                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   select                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     users.id,                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     users.name,                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     count(posts.id) as post_count                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   from users                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   left join posts on users.id = posts.user_id                                                                                                                                                                               +
   group by users.id, users.name;                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Materialized view (stored, faster, needs refresh)                                                                                                                                                                        +
 create materialized view popular_posts as                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   select * from posts                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   where likes > 100                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   order by likes desc;                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Refresh materialized view                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 refresh materialized view popular_posts;                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Authentication                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Setup Authentication                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **1. Enable Auth Providers** (Dashboard → Authentication → Providers)                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **2. Configure Email Templates** (Dashboard → Authentication → Email Templates)                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **3. Implement in Code:**                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Email/Password Authentication                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Sign up                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signUp({                                                                                                                                                                        +
   email: ''user@example.com'',                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   password: ''secure-password-123'',                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   options: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     data: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
       first_name: ''John'',                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
       last_name: ''Doe''                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Sign in                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithPassword({                                                                                                                                                            +
   email: ''user@example.com'',                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   password: ''secure-password-123''                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Sign out                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 const { error } = await supabase.auth.signOut()                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Magic Link (Passwordless)                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithOtp({                                                                                                                                                                 +
   email: ''user@example.com'',                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   options: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     emailRedirectTo: ''https://example.com/welcome''                                                                                                                                                                        +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### OAuth Providers                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Google OAuth                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth({                                                                                                                                                               +
   provider: ''google'',                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   options: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     redirectTo: ''https://example.com/auth/callback''                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // GitHub OAuth                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithOAuth({                                                                                                                                                               +
   provider: ''github''                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Supported providers:                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 // google, github, gitlab, bitbucket, azure, facebook,                                                                                                                                                                      +
 // twitter, discord, twitch, spotify, slack, apple, notion, etc.                                                                                                                                                            +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Phone Authentication                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Send OTP                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithOtp({                                                                                                                                                                 +
   phone: ''+1234567890''                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Verify OTP                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.verifyOtp({                                                                                                                                                                     +
   phone: ''+1234567890'',                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   token: ''123456'',                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   type: ''sms''                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Session Management                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Get current session                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 const { data: { session } } = await supabase.auth.getSession()                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Get current user (RECOMMENDED for server-side)                                                                                                                                                                           +
 const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Listen for auth changes                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 supabase.auth.onAuthStateChange((event, session) => {                                                                                                                                                                       +
   console.log(event, session)                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   // Events: SIGNED_IN, SIGNED_OUT, TOKEN_REFRESHED, USER_UPDATED                                                                                                                                                           +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Refresh session                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.refreshSession()                                                                                                                                                                +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA)                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Enroll MFA                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.mfa.enroll({                                                                                                                                                                    +
   factorType: ''totp'',                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   friendlyName: ''My Authenticator App''                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Verify MFA                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.mfa.verify({                                                                                                                                                                    +
   factorId: ''factor-id'',                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   code: ''123456''                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Server-Side Auth (Next.js)                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Critical Security Rule**: Always use `getUser()` on the server, NEVER `getSession()`                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // utils/supabase/server.ts                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 import { createServerClient } from ''@supabase/ssr''                                                                                                                                                                        +
 import { cookies } from ''next/headers''                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 export function createClient() {                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   const cookieStore = cookies()                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   return createServerClient(                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL!,                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY!,                                                                                                                                                                             +
     {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       cookies: {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
         get(name: string) {                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
           return cookieStore.get(name)?.value                                                                                                                                                                               +
         },                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
       },                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   )                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // app/profile/page.tsx (Server Component)                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 import { createClient } from ''@/utils/supabase/server''                                                                                                                                                                    +
 import { redirect } from ''next/navigation''                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 export default async function ProfilePage() {                                                                                                                                                                               +
   const supabase = createClient()                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ CORRECT - validates token server-side                                                                                                                                                                               +
   const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   if (!user) {                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     redirect(''/login'')                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   return <div>Welcome {user.email}</div>                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Authentication Helpers                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Check if user is authenticated                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 const isAuthenticated = async () => {                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()                                                                                                                                                                  +
   return !!user                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Get user ID                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 const getUserId = async () => {                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()                                                                                                                                                                  +
   return user?.id                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Update user metadata                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.updateUser({                                                                                                                                                                    +
   data: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     display_name: ''New Name'',                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     avatar_url: ''https://...''                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Storage                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Bucket Management                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Create bucket                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage.createBucket(''avatars'', {                                                                                                                                                  +
   public: false, // Private bucket                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   fileSizeLimit: 1024 * 1024 * 2 // 2MB limit                                                                                                                                                                               +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // List buckets                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage.listBuckets()                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Delete bucket                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage.deleteBucket(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                    +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### File Upload                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Upload file                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 const file = event.target.files[0]                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 const fileName = `${userId}/${Date.now()}-${file.name}`                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                              +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .upload(fileName, file, {                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     cacheControl: ''3600'',                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     upsert: false                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Upload with progress tracking                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                              +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .upload(fileName, file, {                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     cacheControl: ''3600'',                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     onUploadProgress: (progress) => {                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       console.log(`Upload: ${progress.loaded / progress.total * 100}%`)                                                                                                                                                     +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### File Download & Access                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Download file                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                              +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .download(''user1/avatar.png'')                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Get public URL (for public buckets)                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 const { data } = supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .getPublicUrl(''user1/avatar.png'')                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 console.log(data.publicUrl)                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Get signed URL (for private buckets, expires)                                                                                                                                                                            +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                              +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .createSignedUrl(''user1/avatar.png'', 60) // 60 seconds                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 console.log(data.signedUrl)                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### File Operations                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // List files                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                              +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .list(''user1/'', {                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     limit: 100,                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     offset: 0,                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     sortBy: { column: ''name'', order: ''asc'' }                                                                                                                                                                            +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Move file                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                              +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .move(''old-path.png'', ''new-path.png'')                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Copy file                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                              +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .copy(''source.png'', ''destination.png'')                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Delete file                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                              +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .remove([''user1/avatar.png''])                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Delete multiple files                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                              +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .remove([''file1.png'', ''file2.png'', ''file3.png''])                                                                                                                                                                    +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Image Transformation                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Resize and optimize image on-the-fly                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 const { data } = supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   .from(''avatars'')                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .getPublicUrl(''user1/photo.jpg'', {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     transform: {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
       width: 200,                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       height: 200,                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       resize: ''cover'', // or ''contain'', ''fill''                                                                                                                                                                        +
       quality: 80,                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       format: ''webp''                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Storage RLS Policies                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- Allow users to upload to their own folder                                                                                                                                                                                +
 create policy "Users can upload own files"                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   on storage.objects for insert                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   with check (                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     bucket_id = ''avatars''                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     and auth.uid()::text = (storage.foldername(name))[1]                                                                                                                                                                    +
   );                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Allow users to read their own files                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 create policy "Users can read own files"                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   on storage.objects for select                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   using (                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     bucket_id = ''avatars''                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     and auth.uid()::text = (storage.foldername(name))[1]                                                                                                                                                                    +
   );                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Allow public read for avatars                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 create policy "Public avatars are readable"                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   on storage.objects for select                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   using (bucket_id = ''avatars'');                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## JavaScript Client API                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Installation & Setup                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 npm install @supabase/supabase-js                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { createClient } from ''@supabase/supabase-js''                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const supabase = createClient(                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   ''https://your-project.supabase.co'',                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   ''your-anon-key''                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 )                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Query Data (SELECT)                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Select all                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Select specific columns                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''id, title, created_at'')                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Select with relationships (JOIN)                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(`                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     id,                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     title,                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     author:users (                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       id,                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
       name,                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
       email                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   `)                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Inner join (only posts with authors)                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''title, users!inner(name)'')                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Count records                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'', { count: ''exact'', head: true })                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 console.log(error ? error : data) // Returns count                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Filtering                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Equality                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .eq(''status'', ''published'')                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Not equal                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .neq(''status'', ''draft'')                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Greater than / Less than                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .gt(''likes'', 100)                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   .lt(''created_at'', ''2024-01-01'')                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // In array                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .in(''category'', [''tech'', ''science'', ''programming''])                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Text search                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .like(''title'', ''%React%'')                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .ilike(''title'', ''%react%'') // Case-insensitive                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Is null / not null                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .is(''deleted_at'', null)                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Multiple filters (AND)                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .eq(''status'', ''published'')                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .gt(''likes'', 50)                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .order(''created_at'', { ascending: false })                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // OR conditions                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .or(''status.eq.published,status.eq.featured'')                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Ordering & Pagination                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Order by                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .order(''created_at'', { ascending: false })                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Multiple order                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .order(''category'')                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .order(''created_at'', { ascending: false })                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Limit                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .limit(10)                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Pagination with range                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .range(0, 9) // First 10 items (0-9)                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const { data: page2 } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .range(10, 19) // Next 10 items (10-19)                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Insert Data                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Insert single record                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .insert({                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     title: ''New Post'',                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     content: ''Post content'',                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     user_id: userId                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .select() // Return inserted record                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Insert multiple records                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .insert([                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     { title: ''Post 1'', content: ''Content 1'' },                                                                                                                                                                          +
     { title: ''Post 2'', content: ''Content 2'' },                                                                                                                                                                          +
     { title: ''Post 3'', content: ''Content 3'' }                                                                                                                                                                           +
   ])                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .select()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Update Data                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Update matching records                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .update({ status: ''published'' })                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .eq(''id'', postId)                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   .select()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Update multiple fields                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .update({                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     title: ''Updated Title'',                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     content: ''Updated content'',                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     updated_at: new Date().toISOString()                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .eq(''id'', postId)                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   .select()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Upsert (Insert or Update)                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Upsert - insert if not exists, update if exists                                                                                                                                                                          +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''profiles'')                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   .upsert({                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     id: userId,                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     username: ''john_doe'',                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     updated_at: new Date().toISOString()                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .select()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Delete Data                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Delete matching records                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 const { error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .delete()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   .eq(''id'', postId)                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Delete with condition                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 const { error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .delete()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   .eq(''user_id'', userId)                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   .eq(''status'', ''draft'')                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Call PostgreSQL Functions (RPC)                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Call database function                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .rpc(''get_popular_posts'', {                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     min_likes: 100,                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     category: ''tech''                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Example function in database:                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 /*                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 create or replace function get_popular_posts(min_likes int, category text)                                                                                                                                                  +
 returns setof posts                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 language sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 as $$                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   select * from posts                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   where likes >= min_likes                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   and category = category                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   order by likes desc;                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 $$;                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 */                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Error Handling                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 if (error) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   console.error(''Error code:'', error.code)                                                                                                                                                                                +
   console.error(''Error message:'', error.message)                                                                                                                                                                          +
   console.error(''Error details:'', error.details)                                                                                                                                                                          +
   console.error(''Error hint:'', error.hint)                                                                                                                                                                                +
   // Handle error appropriately                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   return                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Use data safely                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 console.log(data)                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### TypeScript Support                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Define database types                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 type Database = {                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   public: {                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     Tables: {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
       posts: {                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
         Row: {                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
           id: number                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
           title: string                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
           content: string                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
           user_id: string                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
           created_at: string                                                                                                                                                                                                +
         }                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
         Insert: {                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
           id?: number                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
           title: string                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
           content: string                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
           user_id: string                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
           created_at?: string                                                                                                                                                                                               +
         }                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
         Update: {                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
           id?: number                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
           title?: string                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
           content?: string                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
           user_id?: string                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
           created_at?: string                                                                                                                                                                                               +
         }                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
       }                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Create typed client                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 const supabase = createClient<Database>(url, key)                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Now you get full type safety!                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 // data is typed as Database[''public''][''Tables''][''posts''][''Row''][]                                                                                                                                                  +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Generate TypeScript Types                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 # Generate types from your database                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 npx supabase gen types typescript --project-id your-project-id > types/database.types.ts                                                                                                                                    +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Real-time                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Subscribe to Database Changes                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Subscribe to all changes on a table                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 const channel = supabase                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   .channel(''posts-channel'')                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   .on(                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     ''postgres_changes'',                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       event: ''*'', // INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, or * for all                                                                                                                                                                 +
       schema: ''public'',                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
       table: ''posts''                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     },                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     (payload) => {                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       console.log(''Change received!'', payload)                                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   )                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   .subscribe()                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Subscribe to specific events                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const channel = supabase                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   .channel(''posts-inserts'')                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   .on(                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     ''postgres_changes'',                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       event: ''INSERT'',                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
       schema: ''public'',                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
       table: ''posts''                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     },                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     (payload) => {                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       console.log(''New post:'', payload.new)                                                                                                                                                                               +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   )                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   .subscribe()                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Subscribe with filter                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 const channel = supabase                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   .channel(''my-posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   .on(                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     ''postgres_changes'',                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       event: ''*'',                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       schema: ''public'',                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
       table: ''posts'',                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
       filter: `user_id=eq.${userId}`                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     },                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     (payload) => {                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       console.log(''My post changed:'', payload)                                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   )                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   .subscribe()                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Unsubscribe                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 channel.unsubscribe()                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Broadcast Messages                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Send messages to other clients                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 const channel = supabase.channel(''room-1'')                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Send broadcast                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 await channel.send({                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   type: ''broadcast'',                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   event: ''cursor-pos'',                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   payload: { x: 100, y: 200, user: ''John'' }                                                                                                                                                                               +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Receive broadcasts                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 channel                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   .on(''broadcast'', { event: ''cursor-pos'' }, (payload) => {                                                                                                                                                              +
     console.log(''Cursor position:'', payload)                                                                                                                                                                              +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .subscribe()                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Presence Tracking                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Track user presence                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 const channel = supabase.channel(''room-1'')                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Track your presence                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 await channel.track({                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   user_id: userId,                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   online_at: new Date().toISOString()                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Listen to presence changes                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 channel                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   .on(''presence'', { event: ''sync'' }, () => {                                                                                                                                                                            +
     const state = channel.presenceState()                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     console.log(''Online users:'', state)                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .on(''presence'', { event: ''join'' }, ({ newPresences }) => {                                                                                                                                                            +
     console.log(''User joined:'', newPresences)                                                                                                                                                                             +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .on(''presence'', { event: ''leave'' }, ({ leftPresences }) => {                                                                                                                                                          +
     console.log(''User left:'', leftPresences)                                                                                                                                                                              +
   })                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .subscribe()                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Best Practices                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. Always Enable RLS                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- ✅ GOOD - protect your data                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 alter table posts enable row level security;                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 create policy "Users view own posts"                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   on posts for select                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   using (auth.uid() = user_id);                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- ❌ BAD - anyone can access all data                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- No RLS policies = public access by default!                                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. Use Server-Side Auth Correctly                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ GOOD - validates token                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 const { data: { user } } = await supabase.auth.getUser()                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ BAD - doesn''t revalidate, security risk!                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const { data: { session } } = await supabase.auth.getSession()                                                                                                                                                              +
 // Never use getSession() for auth checks on server!                                                                                                                                                                        +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. Handle Errors Properly                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ GOOD - check errors                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 if (error) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   console.error(''Database error:'', error.message)                                                                                                                                                                         +
   return { error: ''Failed to fetch posts'' }                                                                                                                                                                               +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 return { data }                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ BAD - ignore errors                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 const { data } = await supabase.from(''posts'').select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                               +
 // What if query failed? Data could be null/undefined!                                                                                                                                                                      +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 4. Use TypeScript Types                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ GOOD - type safety                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 import { Database } from ''@/types/database.types''                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const supabase = createClient<Database>(url, key)                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Now you get autocomplete and type checking!                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ BAD - no types                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 const supabase = createClient(url, key)                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 // No type safety, easy to make mistakes                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 5. Pagination for Large Datasets                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ GOOD - paginate large results                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 const PAGE_SIZE = 20                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .range(offset, offset + PAGE_SIZE - 1)                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ BAD - fetch everything (max 1000 rows anyway)                                                                                                                                                                         +
 const { data } = await supabase.from(''posts'').select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                               +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 6. Use Foreign Keys                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- ✅ GOOD - enforce referential integrity                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 create table posts (                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   id bigint primary key,                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   user_id uuid references auth.users(id) on delete cascade                                                                                                                                                                  +
 );                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- ❌ BAD - no relationship enforcement                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 create table posts (                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   id bigint primary key,                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   user_id uuid  -- What if user is deleted?                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 );                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 7. Index Frequently Queried Columns                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- ✅ GOOD - speed up queries                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 create index posts_user_id_idx on posts(user_id);                                                                                                                                                                           +
 create index posts_created_at_idx on posts(created_at desc);                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Queries on these columns are now fast!                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 8. Clean Up Realtime Subscriptions                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ GOOD - unsubscribe when done                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 useEffect(() => {                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   const channel = supabase.channel(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                               +
     .on(''postgres_changes'', {                                                                                                                                                                                             +
       event: ''*'',                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       schema: ''public'',                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
       table: ''posts''                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     }, handleChange)                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     .subscribe()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   return () => {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     channel.unsubscribe() // Clean up!                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }, [])                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ BAD - memory leak                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 useEffect(() => {                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   supabase.channel(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     .on(''postgres_changes'', ...)                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     .subscribe()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   // No cleanup!                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 }, [])                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Important Things to Know                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. Row Level Security is CRITICAL                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Without RLS, your data is PUBLIC by default!**                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 -- Enable RLS on ALL tables                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 alter table your_table enable row level security;                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Create policies for access control                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 create policy "name" on your_table                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   for select                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   using (auth.uid() = user_id);                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. Default Row Limit is 1,000                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Queries return max 1,000 rows by default. Adjust in project settings or use pagination.                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Returns max 1,000 rows                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 const { data } = await supabase.from(''posts'').select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Use pagination for more                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 const { data } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   .from(''posts'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .range(0, 999) // First 1000                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. Server vs Client Auth Methods                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 | Method | Where to Use | Security |                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 |--------|--------------|----------|                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 | `getUser()` | Server-side | ✅ Validates token |                                                                                                                                                                          +
 | `getSession()` | Client-side only | ❌ No validation |                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 4. Storage Buckets Can Be Public or Private                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Public bucket - anyone can read                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 await supabase.storage.createBucket(''public-avatars'', {                                                                                                                                                                   +
   public: true                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Private bucket - requires signed URLs                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 await supabase.storage.createBucket(''private-docs'', {                                                                                                                                                                     +
   public: false                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 5. PostgreSQL Functions for Complex Logic                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Move complex business logic to database functions:                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 create or replace function increment_view_count(post_id bigint)                                                                                                                                                             +
 returns void                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 language plpgsql                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 as $$                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 begin                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   update posts                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   set views = views + 1                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   where id = post_id;                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 end;                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 $$;                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 -- Call from client                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 await supabase.rpc(''increment_view_count'', { post_id: 123 })                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 6. Realtime Requires RLS Policies                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Realtime subscriptions respect RLS policies. Users only receive changes they''re allowed to see.                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 7. Use Transactions for Related Operations                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```sql                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 begin;                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   insert into orders (user_id, total) values (''user-123'', 99.99);                                                                                                                                                         +
   update inventory set stock = stock - 1 where product_id = ''prod-456'';                                                                                                                                                   +
 commit;                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 8. Connection Pooling                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Supabase handles connection pooling automatically. No need to manage connections manually.                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 9. Backups                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Free tier**: Daily backups, 7-day retention                                                                                                                                                                               +
 **Pro tier**: Configurable backup frequency and retention                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 10. Local Development                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 # Start local Supabase                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 supabase start                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Stop local Supabase                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 supabase stop                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Reset database                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 supabase db reset                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Generate migration                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 supabase migration new create_posts_table                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Apply migrations                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 supabase db push                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Quick Reference                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Essential Commands                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```bash                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 # CLI                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 npm install -g supabase                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 supabase init                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 supabase start                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 supabase stop                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 supabase db reset                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 # Client                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 npm install @supabase/supabase-js                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 npm install @supabase/ssr  # For SSR frameworks                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Essential Patterns                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Initialize                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 import { createClient } from ''@supabase/supabase-js''                                                                                                                                                                      +
 const supabase = createClient(url, key)                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Query                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''table'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .select(''*'')                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .eq(''column'', ''value'')                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Insert                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''table'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .insert({ column: ''value'' })                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Update                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 const { data, error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   .from(''table'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .update({ column: ''new value'' })                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   .eq(''id'', id)                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Delete                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 const { error } = await supabase                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   .from(''table'')                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   .delete()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   .eq(''id'', id)                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Auth                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithPassword({                                                                                                                                                            +
   email, password                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 })                                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Storage                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 const { data, error } = await supabase.storage                                                                                                                                                                              +
   .from(''bucket'')                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   .upload(''path'', file)                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Realtime                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 const channel = supabase                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   .channel(''channel-name'')                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   .on(''postgres_changes'', { event: ''*'', schema: ''public'', table: ''table'' }, handler)                                                                                                                                +
   .subscribe()                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Summary                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Supabase is a comprehensive backend platform that provides:                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Full PostgreSQL database** with realtime capabilities                                                                                                                                                                  +
 ✅ **Complete authentication system** with 20+ providers                                                                                                                                                                    +
 ✅ **Scalable file storage** with global CDN                                                                                                                                                                                +
 ✅ **Real-time subscriptions** for live updates                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Serverless functions** on the edge                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 ✅ **Row Level Security** for fine-grained access control                                                                                                                                                                   +
 ✅ **Open source** with self-hosting option                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 ✅ **Type-safe APIs** with excellent TypeScript support                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Remember**: Enable RLS on all tables, use `getUser()` on the server, handle errors properly, and leverage PostgreSQL''s power with functions, triggers, and views.                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Start simple, grow as needed** - Supabase scales from prototypes to production applications.                                                                                                                              +
