 -- Insert note: DDD - Value Object                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 INSERT INTO public.notes (id, user_id, category_id, title, content, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (                                                                                                                        +
   '92d9030a-8152-482b-8ca4-f84ad1e10e2c',                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   '6d229373-47dc-4cf4-b4d5-b4f9fc266311',                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   NULL,                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   'DDD - Value Object',                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   '# DDD Tactical Pattern: Value Objects                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 > Deep dive into Value Objects - immutable domain concepts defined by their attributes                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## What is a Value Object                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **A Value Object is an immutable type that is distinguishable only by the state of its properties.** Unlike an Entity, which has a unique identifier, two Value Objects with the exact same properties are considered equal.+
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Core Definition                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 > "An object that represents a descriptive aspect of the domain with no conceptual identity is called a Value Object."                                                                                                      +
 > — Eric Evans                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Key Points:**                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - **No identity** - defined only by attributes                                                                                                                                                                              +
 - **Immutable** - cannot change after creation                                                                                                                                                                              +
 - **Replaceable** - create new instance instead of modifying                                                                                                                                                                +
 - **Comparable by value** - equality based on all attributes                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Key Characteristics                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. No Identity                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Value Objects don''t have a unique identifier:                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Not a Value Object (has identity)                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 class User {                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   id: string                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   name: string                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Value Object (no identity)                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 class Money {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   amount: number                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   currency: string                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. Immutability                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Once created, Value Objects cannot change:                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Money {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   private constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     public readonly amount: number,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     public readonly currency: string                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ Returns new instance                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   add(other: Money): Money {                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     if (this.currency !== other.currency) {                                                                                                                                                                                 +
       throw new Error(''Cannot add different currencies'')                                                                                                                                                                  +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return new Money(this.amount + other.amount, this.currency)                                                                                                                                                             +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ❌ Don''t do this                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   // setAmount(amount: number) {                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   //   this.amount = amount                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   // }                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. Structural Equality                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Two Value Objects are equal if all attributes are equal:                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Address {                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly street: string,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     public readonly city: string,                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     public readonly zipCode: string,                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     public readonly country: string                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   equals(other: Address): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     return (                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
       this.street === other.street &&                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       this.city === other.city &&                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       this.zipCode === other.zipCode &&                                                                                                                                                                                     +
       this.country === other.country                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 const address1 = new Address(''123 Main St'', ''NYC'', ''10001'', ''USA'')                                                                                                                                                  +
 const address2 = new Address(''123 Main St'', ''NYC'', ''10001'', ''USA'')                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 console.log(address1.equals(address2)) // true                                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 4. Self-Validation                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Value Objects validate themselves on creation:                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Email {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   private constructor(private readonly value: string) {}                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(email: string): Email {                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     if (!email.match(/^[\w-\.]+@([\w-]+\.)+[\w-]{2,4}$/)) {                                                                                                                                                                 +
       throw new Error(''Invalid email format'')                                                                                                                                                                             +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return new Email(email)                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getValue(): string {                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     return this.value                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Valid email                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 const email = Email.create(''user@example.com'')                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ Throws error                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 const invalid = Email.create(''not-an-email'')                                                                                                                                                                              +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 5. Side-Effect Free Functions                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Methods don''t modify state, only return new values:                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class DateRange {                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly start: Date,                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     public readonly end: Date                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   ) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     if (start > end) {                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
       throw new Error(''Start date must be before end date'')                                                                                                                                                               +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ Returns new instance                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   extendBy(days: number): DateRange {                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     const newEnd = new Date(this.end)                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     newEnd.setDate(newEnd.getDate() + days)                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     return new DateRange(this.start, newEnd)                                                                                                                                                                                +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   durationInDays(): number {                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     return (this.end.getTime() - this.start.getTime()) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24)                                                                                                                                              +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## When to Use                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### ✅ Use Value Objects For:                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **1. Domain Concepts Without Identity**                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 - Money (amount + currency)                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 - Address (street, city, zip)                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 - Date ranges                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 - Coordinates (latitude, longitude)                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - Measurements (value + unit)                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **2. Primitive Obsession**                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 Replace primitive types with domain concepts:                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Primitive obsession                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 function processOrder(amount: number, currency: string) {}                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Value Object                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 function processOrder(price: Money) {}                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **3. Business Rules and Validation**                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 Encapsulate domain logic:                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Age {                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   private constructor(private readonly value: number) {}                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(years: number): Age {                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     if (years < 0) throw new Error(''Age cannot be negative'')                                                                                                                                                              +
     if (years > 150) throw new Error(''Age seems unrealistic'')                                                                                                                                                             +
     return new Age(years)                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   isAdult(): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     return this.value >= 18                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   isChild(): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     return this.value < 18                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **4. Composition**                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 Build complex objects from simpler ones:                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class FullName {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly firstName: string,                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     public readonly lastName: string                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getFullName(): string {                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     return `${this.firstName} ${this.lastName}`                                                                                                                                                                             +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class Person {                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly id: PersonId,                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     public readonly name: FullName,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     public readonly email: Email,                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     public readonly address: Address                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### ❌ Don''t Use Value Objects For:                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **1. Entities with Identity**                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Wrong - User has identity                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class User extends ValueObject {                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   id: string                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   name: string                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Correct - User is an Entity                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 class User {                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly id: UserId,                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     public name: UserName                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **2. Simple Pass-Through**                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 Don''t wrap every primitive unnecessarily:                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Overkill for simple cases                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class PageNumber extends ValueObject {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   value: number                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Use primitive if no domain logic                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 function goToPage(pageNumber: number) {}                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Implementation                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### TypeScript Implementation                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Base Value Object Class:**                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 abstract class ValueObject<T> {                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   protected abstract getEqualityComponents(): T[]                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   equals(other: ValueObject<T>): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     if (!other || other.constructor !== this.constructor) {                                                                                                                                                                 +
       return false                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     const components = this.getEqualityComponents()                                                                                                                                                                         +
     const otherComponents = other.getEqualityComponents()                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     if (components.length !== otherComponents.length) {                                                                                                                                                                     +
       return false                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     return components.every((component, index) =>                                                                                                                                                                           +
       this.deepEquals(component, otherComponents[index])                                                                                                                                                                    +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private deepEquals(a: any, b: any): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                             +
     if (a === b) return true                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     if (a == null || b == null) return false                                                                                                                                                                                +
     if (a.equals && typeof a.equals === ''function'') {                                                                                                                                                                     +
       return a.equals(b)                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return JSON.stringify(a) === JSON.stringify(b)                                                                                                                                                                          +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Using Records (Modern TypeScript):**                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // Simple value object with record                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 type Money = {                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   readonly amount: number                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   readonly currency: string                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 function createMoney(amount: number, currency: string): Money {                                                                                                                                                             +
   if (amount < 0) throw new Error(''Amount cannot be negative'')                                                                                                                                                            +
   if (!currency) throw new Error(''Currency required'')                                                                                                                                                                     +
   return { amount, currency }                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 function addMoney(a: Money, b: Money): Money {                                                                                                                                                                              +
   if (a.currency !== b.currency) {                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     throw new Error(''Cannot add different currencies'')                                                                                                                                                                    +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   return createMoney(a.amount + b.amount, a.currency)                                                                                                                                                                       +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Examples                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Example 1: Money                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Money extends ValueObject<Money> {                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   private constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     public readonly amount: number,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     public readonly currency: Currency                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   ) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     super()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     if (amount < 0) {                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       throw new Error(''Amount cannot be negative'')                                                                                                                                                                        +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(amount: number, currency: Currency): Money {                                                                                                                                                                +
     return new Money(amount, currency)                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   add(other: Money): Money {                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     if (!this.currency.equals(other.currency)) {                                                                                                                                                                            +
       throw new Error(''Cannot add different currencies'')                                                                                                                                                                  +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return new Money(this.amount + other.amount, this.currency)                                                                                                                                                             +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   subtract(other: Money): Money {                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     if (!this.currency.equals(other.currency)) {                                                                                                                                                                            +
       throw new Error(''Cannot subtract different currencies'')                                                                                                                                                             +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return new Money(this.amount - other.amount, this.currency)                                                                                                                                                             +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   multiply(factor: number): Money {                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     return new Money(this.amount * factor, this.currency)                                                                                                                                                                   +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   isGreaterThan(other: Money): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     if (!this.currency.equals(other.currency)) {                                                                                                                                                                            +
       throw new Error(''Cannot compare different currencies'')                                                                                                                                                              +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return this.amount > other.amount                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   protected getEqualityComponents(): any[] {                                                                                                                                                                                +
     return [this.amount, this.currency]                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class Currency extends ValueObject<Currency> {                                                                                                                                                                              +
   private constructor(public readonly code: string) {                                                                                                                                                                       +
     super()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     if (code.length !== 3) {                                                                                                                                                                                                +
       throw new Error(''Currency code must be 3 characters'')                                                                                                                                                               +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static USD = new Currency(''USD'')                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   static EUR = new Currency(''EUR'')                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   static GBP = new Currency(''GBP'')                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   protected getEqualityComponents(): any[] {                                                                                                                                                                                +
     return [this.code]                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Usage                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 const price1 = Money.create(100, Currency.USD)                                                                                                                                                                              +
 const price2 = Money.create(50, Currency.USD)                                                                                                                                                                               +
 const total = price1.add(price2) // $150                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Example 2: Address                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Address extends ValueObject<Address> {                                                                                                                                                                                +
   private constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     public readonly street: string,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     public readonly city: string,                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     public readonly zipCode: ZipCode,                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     public readonly country: Country                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   ) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     super()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     street: string,                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     city: string,                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     zipCode: string,                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     country: string                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   ): Address {                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     return new Address(                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
       street,                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
       city,                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
       ZipCode.create(zipCode),                                                                                                                                                                                              +
       Country.create(country)                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getFullAddress(): string {                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     return `${this.street}, ${this.city} ${this.zipCode.getValue()}, ${this.country.getName()}`                                                                                                                             +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   protected getEqualityComponents(): any[] {                                                                                                                                                                                +
     return [this.street, this.city, this.zipCode, this.country]                                                                                                                                                             +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class ZipCode extends ValueObject<ZipCode> {                                                                                                                                                                                +
   private constructor(private readonly value: string) {                                                                                                                                                                     +
     super()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(value: string): ZipCode {                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     if (!/^\d{5}(-\d{4})?$/.test(value)) {                                                                                                                                                                                  +
       throw new Error(''Invalid US zip code format'')                                                                                                                                                                       +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return new ZipCode(value)                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getValue(): string {                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     return this.value                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   protected getEqualityComponents(): any[] {                                                                                                                                                                                +
     return [this.value]                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Example 3: Email                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Email extends ValueObject<Email> {                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   private static readonly EMAIL_REGEX = /^[\w-\.]+@([\w-]+\.)+[\w-]{2,4}$/                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private constructor(private readonly value: string) {                                                                                                                                                                     +
     super()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(email: string): Email {                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     const normalized = email.trim().toLowerCase()                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     if (!this.EMAIL_REGEX.test(normalized)) {                                                                                                                                                                               +
       throw new Error(`Invalid email: ${email}`)                                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     return new Email(normalized)                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getValue(): string {                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     return this.value                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getDomain(): string {                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     return this.value.split(''@'')[1]                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getLocalPart(): string {                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     return this.value.split(''@'')[0]                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   protected getEqualityComponents(): any[] {                                                                                                                                                                                +
     return [this.value]                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Usage                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 const email = Email.create(''user@example.com'')                                                                                                                                                                            +
 console.log(email.getDomain()) // ''example.com''                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Example 4: Date Range                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class DateRange extends ValueObject<DateRange> {                                                                                                                                                                            +
   private constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     public readonly start: Date,                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     public readonly end: Date                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   ) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     super()                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     if (start > end) {                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
       throw new Error(''Start date must be before or equal to end date'')                                                                                                                                                   +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(start: Date, end: Date): DateRange {                                                                                                                                                                        +
     return new DateRange(start, end)                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static fromDuration(start: Date, days: number): DateRange {                                                                                                                                                               +
     const end = new Date(start)                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     end.setDate(end.getDate() + days)                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return new DateRange(start, end)                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getDurationInDays(): number {                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     const milliseconds = this.end.getTime() - this.start.getTime()                                                                                                                                                          +
     return Math.ceil(milliseconds / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24))                                                                                                                                                                  +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   contains(date: Date): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     return date >= this.start && date <= this.end                                                                                                                                                                           +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   overlaps(other: DateRange): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     return this.start <= other.end && this.end >= other.start                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   extend(days: number): DateRange {                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     const newEnd = new Date(this.end)                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     newEnd.setDate(newEnd.getDate() + days)                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     return new DateRange(this.start, newEnd)                                                                                                                                                                                +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   protected getEqualityComponents(): any[] {                                                                                                                                                                                +
     return [this.start.getTime(), this.end.getTime()]                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Usage                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 const vacation = DateRange.create(                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   new Date(''2024-07-01''),                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   new Date(''2024-07-15'')                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 )                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 console.log(vacation.getDurationInDays()) // 15                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Best Practices                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. Make Constructors Private                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Force creation through factory methods:                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Money {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   private constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     public readonly amount: number,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     public readonly currency: string                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ Factory method with validation                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   static create(amount: number, currency: string): Money {                                                                                                                                                                  +
     if (amount < 0) throw new Error(''Amount cannot be negative'')                                                                                                                                                          +
     return new Money(amount, currency)                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. Validate on Creation                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Never allow invalid state:                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Age {                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   private constructor(private readonly years: number) {}                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(years: number): Age {                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     if (years < 0) throw new Error(''Age cannot be negative'')                                                                                                                                                              +
     if (years > 150) throw new Error(''Age unrealistic'')                                                                                                                                                                   +
     return new Age(years)                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. Use Meaningful Names                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Names should reflect domain concepts:                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Poor naming                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 class Data {                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   value: number                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Domain-driven naming                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 class Temperature {                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   static fromCelsius(degrees: number): Temperature                                                                                                                                                                          +
   static fromFahrenheit(degrees: number): Temperature                                                                                                                                                                       +
   toCelsius(): number                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   toFahrenheit(): number                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 4. Encapsulate Business Logic                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Put domain logic in Value Objects:                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Percentage {                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   private constructor(private readonly value: number) {}                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(value: number): Percentage {                                                                                                                                                                                +
     if (value < 0 || value > 100) {                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       throw new Error(''Percentage must be between 0 and 100'')                                                                                                                                                             +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return new Percentage(value)                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   applyTo(amount: number): number {                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     return amount * (this.value / 100)                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   isZero(): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return this.value === 0                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   isFull(): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return this.value === 100                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 5. Compose Value Objects                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Build complex concepts from simpler ones:                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class ContactInformation {                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly email: Email,                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     public readonly phone: PhoneNumber,                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     public readonly address: Address                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class Customer {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly id: CustomerId,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     public readonly name: FullName,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     public readonly contact: ContactInformation                                                                                                                                                                             +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 6. Avoid Primitive Obsession                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 Replace primitives with Value Objects:                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Primitive obsession                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   amount: number                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   currency: string                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   email: string                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Rich domain model                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly total: Money,                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     public readonly customerEmail: Email                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Common Mistakes                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### ❌ Mistake 1: Making Value Objects Mutable                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Wrong - mutable                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 class Money {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   amount: number                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   currency: string                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   setAmount(amount: number) {                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     this.amount = amount                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Correct - immutable                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 class Money {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly amount: number,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     public readonly currency: string                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   withAmount(amount: number): Money {                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return new Money(amount, this.currency)                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### ❌ Mistake 2: Using Identity                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Wrong - Value Object shouldn''t have ID                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Address {                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   id: string                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   street: string                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   city: string                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Correct - no identity                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 class Address {                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly street: string,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     public readonly city: string                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### ❌ Mistake 3: Skipping Validation                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Wrong - no validation                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 class Email {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   constructor(public readonly value: string) {}                                                                                                                                                                             +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Correct - validate on creation                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 class Email {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   private constructor(private readonly value: string) {}                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(email: string): Email {                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     if (!email.includes(''@'')) {                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       throw new Error(''Invalid email'')                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return new Email(email)                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### ❌ Mistake 4: Overusing Value Objects                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Overkill for simple cases                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class PageNumber extends ValueObject {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   value: number                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class LineNumber extends ValueObject {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   value: number                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Use primitives when no domain logic                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 function scrollToLine(lineNumber: number) {}                                                                                                                                                                                +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Summary                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Key Takeaways                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Value Objects are immutable**                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 - Cannot change after creation                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 - Return new instances for modifications                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Defined by attributes, not identity**                                                                                                                                                                                  +
 - No unique identifier                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 - Equality based on all properties                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Self-validating**                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 - Validate on creation                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 - Impossible to create invalid instance                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Encapsulate domain logic**                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Business rules in Value Objects                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 - Rich domain model                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Fight primitive obsession**                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 - Replace primitives with domain concepts                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 - Type safety and expressiveness                                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### When to Use                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Domain concepts without identity                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 - Business rules and validation                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Composition of complex objects                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 - Fighting primitive obsession                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### When NOT to Use                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Objects with identity (use Entity)                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 - Mutable concepts                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 - Simple pass-through values                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - No domain logic                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
