   NULL,                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   'DDD - Aggregate',                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   '# DDD Tactical Pattern: Aggregates                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 > Deep dive into Aggregates - consistency boundaries that group related entities and value objects                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## What is an Aggregate                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **An Aggregate is a cluster of domain objects (entities and value objects) that can be treated as a single unit.** It defines a consistency boundary around related objects and ensures that business rules are enforced.   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Core Definition                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 > "An Aggregate is a cluster of associated objects that we treat as a unit for the purpose of data changes. Each Aggregate has a root and a boundary."                                                                      +
 > — Eric Evans                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Key Points:**                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - **Consistency boundary** - enforces business invariants                                                                                                                                                                   +
 - **Transactional boundary** - changes committed as a unit                                                                                                                                                                  +
 - **Aggregate root** - single entry point for access                                                                                                                                                                        +
 - **Controls access** - external objects reference only the root                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Key Characteristics                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. Consistency Boundary                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Aggregates enforce invariants (business rules):**                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   // Aggregate Root                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly id: OrderId,                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     private customerId: CustomerId,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     private items: OrderLine[], // Internal entities                                                                                                                                                                        +
     private shippingAddress: Address, // Value object                                                                                                                                                                       +
     private status: OrderStatus                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   ) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     this.validateInvariants()                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ Invariant: Order must have at least one item                                                                                                                                                                        +
   addItem(product: Product, quantity: number): void {                                                                                                                                                                       +
     const line = OrderLine.create(product, quantity)                                                                                                                                                                        +
     this.items.push(line)                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     this.validateInvariants()                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ Invariant: Cannot modify shipped order                                                                                                                                                                              +
   removeItem(productId: ProductId): void {                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     if (this.status.isShipped()) {                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       throw new Error(''Cannot modify shipped order'')                                                                                                                                                                      +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     this.items = this.items.filter(                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       item => !item.productId.equals(productId)                                                                                                                                                                             +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     this.validateInvariants()                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private validateInvariants(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     if (this.items.length === 0 && !this.status.isDraft()) {                                                                                                                                                                +
       throw new Error(''Order must have at least one item'')                                                                                                                                                                +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. Transactional Boundary                                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **One aggregate = one transaction:**                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ Good: Single aggregate transaction                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 async placeOrder(order: Order): Promise<void> {                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // All changes to Order aggregate in one transaction                                                                                                                                                                      +
   order.confirm()                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   await this.orderRepository.save(order)                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ Bad: Multiple aggregates in one transaction                                                                                                                                                                           +
 async placeOrder(order: Order, customer: Customer): Promise<void> {                                                                                                                                                         +
   // Don''t do this - crosses aggregate boundaries                                                                                                                                                                          +
   order.confirm()                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   customer.addOrder(order.id)                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   await this.orderRepository.save(order)                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   await this.customerRepository.save(customer)                                                                                                                                                                              +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. Aggregate Root                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Single entry point for all operations:**                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   // ✅ Public methods on root                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   addItem(product: Product, quantity: number): void {                                                                                                                                                                       +
     const line = OrderLine.create(product, quantity)                                                                                                                                                                        +
     this.items.push(line)                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ Root controls internal entities                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   changeItemQuantity(productId: ProductId, newQuantity: number): void {                                                                                                                                                     +
     const item = this.findItem(productId)                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     if (!item) {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
       throw new Error(''Item not found'')                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     // OrderLine is not exposed directly                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     item.changeQuantity(newQuantity)                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private findItem(productId: ProductId): OrderLine | undefined {                                                                                                                                                           +
     return this.items.find(item => item.productId.equals(productId))                                                                                                                                                        +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ Don''t access internal entities directly                                                                                                                                                                              +
 // orderLine.changeQuantity(5) // Wrong!                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 // ✅ Always go through aggregate root                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 order.changeItemQuantity(productId, 5) // Correct!                                                                                                                                                                          +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 4. Reference by Identity                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **External aggregates reference only by ID:**                                                                                                                                                                               +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly id: OrderId,                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     private customerId: CustomerId, // ✅ Reference by ID                                                                                                                                                                   +
     // private customer: Customer,   // ❌ Don''t hold reference                                                                                                                                                            +
     private items: OrderLine[]                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getCustomerId(): CustomerId {                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     return this.customerId                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Access customer separately if needed                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 const order = await orderRepository.findById(orderId)                                                                                                                                                                       +
 const customer = await customerRepository.findById(order.getCustomerId())                                                                                                                                                   +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Aggregate Root                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Responsibilities                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **1. Enforce Invariants**                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class ShoppingCart {                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   private static readonly MAX_ITEMS = 50                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   addItem(product: Product, quantity: number): void {                                                                                                                                                                       +
     if (this.items.length >= ShoppingCart.MAX_ITEMS) {                                                                                                                                                                      +
       throw new Error(''Cart is full'')                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     // Add item logic                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **2. Control Access**                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class BankAccount {                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   private transactions: Transaction[] = []                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ Controlled access through root                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   deposit(amount: Money): void {                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     const transaction = Transaction.createDeposit(amount)                                                                                                                                                                   +
     this.transactions.push(transaction)                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     this.balance = this.balance.add(amount)                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ❌ Don''t expose internal collection                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   // getTransactions(): Transaction[] {                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   //   return this.transactions                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // }                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ Provide controlled access                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   getTransactionHistory(): readonly Transaction[] {                                                                                                                                                                         +
     return Object.freeze([...this.transactions])                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **3. Coordinate Changes**                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Reservation {                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   changeGuests(numberOfGuests: number): void {                                                                                                                                                                              +
     // Coordinate changes across aggregate                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     this.validateGuestCount(numberOfGuests)                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     this.adjustRoomAllocation(numberOfGuests)                                                                                                                                                                               +
     this.recalculatePrice()                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private validateGuestCount(count: number): void {                                                                                                                                                                         +
     if (count > this.room.maxOccupancy) {                                                                                                                                                                                   +
       throw new Error(''Exceeds room capacity'')                                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private adjustRoomAllocation(count: number): void {                                                                                                                                                                       +
     // Logic to adjust rooms                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private recalculatePrice(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     // Recalculate based on new guest count                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Consistency Boundaries                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### What are Invariants?                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Invariants are business rules that must always be true:**                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Product {                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Invariant: Price must be positive                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   // Invariant: Stock cannot be negative                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly id: ProductId,                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     private price: Money,                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     private stock: number                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   ) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     this.validateInvariants()                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   changePrice(newPrice: Money): void {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     this.price = newPrice                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     this.validateInvariants()                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   removeStock(quantity: number): void {                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     this.stock -= quantity                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     this.validateInvariants()                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private validateInvariants(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     if (this.price.isLessThanOrEqual(Money.zero())) {                                                                                                                                                                       +
       throw new Error(''Price must be positive'')                                                                                                                                                                           +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     if (this.stock < 0) {                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
       throw new Error(''Stock cannot be negative'')                                                                                                                                                                         +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Designing Boundaries                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Rule: Model true invariants in consistency boundaries**                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ Good: Related objects with shared invariant                                                                                                                                                                           +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   // Invariant: Total must equal sum of line items                                                                                                                                                                          +
   private items: OrderLine[]                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   private total: Money                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   addItem(item: OrderLine): void {                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     this.items.push(item)                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     this.recalculateTotal() // Maintain invariant                                                                                                                                                                           +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private recalculateTotal(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     this.total = this.items.reduce(                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       (sum, item) => sum.add(item.getSubtotal()),                                                                                                                                                                           +
       Money.zero()                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ Bad: Unrelated objects in same aggregate                                                                                                                                                                              +
 class OrderWithCustomer {                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   // No true invariant between Order and Customer                                                                                                                                                                           +
   private order: Order                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   private customer: Customer // Should be separate aggregate                                                                                                                                                                +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Transaction Boundaries                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **One transaction per aggregate:**                                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ Correct: Single aggregate transaction                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 class OrderService {                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   async placeOrder(command: PlaceOrderCommand): Promise<void> {                                                                                                                                                             +
     const order = Order.create(command.customerId, command.items)                                                                                                                                                           +
     order.confirm()                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     await this.orderRepository.save(order)                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ Wrong: Multiple aggregates in transaction                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class OrderService {                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   async placeOrder(command: PlaceOrderCommand): Promise<void> {                                                                                                                                                             +
     const order = Order.create(command.customerId, command.items)                                                                                                                                                           +
     const customer = await this.customerRepository.findById(command.customerId)                                                                                                                                             +
     const inventory = await this.inventoryRepository.findById(command.warehouseId)                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     // Don''t modify multiple aggregates in one transaction                                                                                                                                                                 +
     order.confirm()                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     customer.addOrder(order.id)                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     inventory.reserve(command.items)                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     await this.orderRepository.save(order)                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     await this.customerRepository.save(customer)                                                                                                                                                                            +
     await this.inventoryRepository.save(inventory)                                                                                                                                                                          +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Design Rules                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Rule 1: Small Aggregates                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Keep aggregates small - prefer smaller over larger:**                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ❌ Large aggregate - hard to maintain                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 class Customer {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   orders: Order[]           // Too much                                                                                                                                                                                     +
   addresses: Address[]      // Should be separate                                                                                                                                                                           +
   paymentMethods: PaymentMethod[]  // Should be separate                                                                                                                                                                    +
   preferences: Preferences  // Should be separate                                                                                                                                                                           +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ✅ Small aggregate                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 class Customer {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly id: CustomerId,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     private name: CustomerName,                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     private email: Email,                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     private defaultAddressId: AddressId  // Reference only                                                                                                                                                                  +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Separate aggregates                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 class Order { }                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class Address { }                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 class PaymentMethod { }                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Rule 2: Reference by Identity                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Use IDs to reference other aggregates:**                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly id: OrderId,                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     private customerId: CustomerId,     // ✅ ID reference                                                                                                                                                                  +
     private shippingAddressId: AddressId, // ✅ ID reference                                                                                                                                                                +
     private items: OrderLine[]                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Retrieve referenced aggregates separately                                                                                                                                                                                +
 const order = await orderRepository.findById(orderId)                                                                                                                                                                       +
 const customer = await customerRepository.findById(order.customerId)                                                                                                                                                        +
 const address = await addressRepository.findById(order.shippingAddressId)                                                                                                                                                   +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Rule 3: Eventually Consistent                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Use eventual consistency between aggregates:**                                                                                                                                                                            +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // When order is placed, update inventory eventually                                                                                                                                                                        +
 class OrderService {                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   async placeOrder(command: PlaceOrderCommand): Promise<void> {                                                                                                                                                             +
     const order = Order.create(command.customerId, command.items)                                                                                                                                                           +
     order.confirm()                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     await this.orderRepository.save(order)                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     // ✅ Publish event for eventual consistency                                                                                                                                                                            +
     await this.eventBus.publish(                                                                                                                                                                                            +
       new OrderPlacedEvent(order.id, order.items)                                                                                                                                                                           +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class InventoryService {                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   async handleOrderPlaced(event: OrderPlacedEvent): Promise<void> {                                                                                                                                                         +
     // Eventually consistent update                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     const inventory = await this.inventoryRepository.findById(event.warehouseId)                                                                                                                                            +
     inventory.reserve(event.items)                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     await this.inventoryRepository.save(inventory)                                                                                                                                                                          +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Rule 4: One Repository Per Aggregate                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 **Each aggregate has its own repository:**                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ Correct: One repository per aggregate root                                                                                                                                                                            +
 interface OrderRepository {                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   findById(id: OrderId): Promise<Order | null>                                                                                                                                                                              +
   save(order: Order): Promise<void>                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 interface CustomerRepository {                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   findById(id: CustomerId): Promise<Customer | null>                                                                                                                                                                        +
   save(customer: Customer): Promise<void>                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ Wrong: Repository for internal entity                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 // interface OrderLineRepository {                                                                                                                                                                                          +
 //   findById(id: OrderLineId): Promise<OrderLine | null>                                                                                                                                                                   +
 // }                                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Implementation                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Complete Aggregate Example                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   private constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     public readonly id: OrderId,                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     private readonly customerId: CustomerId,                                                                                                                                                                                +
     private status: OrderStatus,                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     private items: OrderLine[],                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     private shippingAddress: Address,                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     private total: Money,                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     private readonly createdAt: Date,                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     private updatedAt: Date                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   ) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     this.validateInvariants()                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Factory method                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   static create(                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     customerId: CustomerId,                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     shippingAddress: Address,                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     items: OrderLine[]                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   ): Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     if (items.length === 0) {                                                                                                                                                                                               +
       throw new Error(''Order must have at least one item'')                                                                                                                                                                +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     const order = new Order(                                                                                                                                                                                                +
       OrderId.create(),                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
       customerId,                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       OrderStatus.Draft,                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
       [...items],                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       shippingAddress,                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
       Money.zero(),                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       new Date(),                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       new Date()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     order.recalculateTotal()                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     return order                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Business methods                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   addItem(product: Product, quantity: number, price: Money): void {                                                                                                                                                         +
     if (!this.canModifyItems()) {                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       throw new Error(''Cannot modify items in current status'')                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     const line = OrderLine.create(product.id, product.name, quantity, price)                                                                                                                                                +
     this.items.push(line)                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     this.recalculateTotal()                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     this.touch()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   removeItem(productId: ProductId): void {                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     if (!this.canModifyItems()) {                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       throw new Error(''Cannot modify items in current status'')                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.items = this.items.filter(                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       item => !item.productId.equals(productId)                                                                                                                                                                             +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     this.recalculateTotal()                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     this.touch()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   changeItemQuantity(productId: ProductId, newQuantity: number): void {                                                                                                                                                     +
     if (!this.canModifyItems()) {                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       throw new Error(''Cannot modify items in current status'')                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     const item = this.findItem(productId)                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     if (!item) {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
       throw new Error(''Item not found in order'')                                                                                                                                                                          +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     item.changeQuantity(newQuantity)                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     this.recalculateTotal()                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     this.touch()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   updateShippingAddress(address: Address): void {                                                                                                                                                                           +
     if (this.status.isShipped()) {                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       throw new Error(''Cannot change address of shipped order'')                                                                                                                                                           +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.shippingAddress = address                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     this.touch()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   confirm(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     if (!this.status.isDraft()) {                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       throw new Error(''Can only confirm draft orders'')                                                                                                                                                                    +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.validateInvariants()                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     this.status = OrderStatus.Confirmed                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     this.touch()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   ship(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     if (!this.status.isConfirmed()) {                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       throw new Error(''Can only ship confirmed orders'')                                                                                                                                                                   +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.status = OrderStatus.Shipped                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     this.touch()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   cancel(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     if (this.status.isShipped()) {                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       throw new Error(''Cannot cancel shipped order'')                                                                                                                                                                      +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.status = OrderStatus.Cancelled                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     this.touch()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Getters                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
   getTotal(): Money {                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return this.total                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getItems(): readonly OrderLine[] {                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     return Object.freeze([...this.items])                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getStatus(): OrderStatus {                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     return this.status                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // Private methods                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   private canModifyItems(): boolean {                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     return this.status.isDraft()                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private findItem(productId: ProductId): OrderLine | undefined {                                                                                                                                                           +
     return this.items.find(item => item.productId.equals(productId))                                                                                                                                                        +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private recalculateTotal(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     this.total = this.items.reduce(                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       (sum, item) => sum.add(item.getSubtotal()),                                                                                                                                                                           +
       Money.zero()                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private touch(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     this.updatedAt = new Date()                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private validateInvariants(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     if (this.items.length === 0 && !this.status.isDraft()) {                                                                                                                                                                +
       throw new Error(''Order must have at least one item'')                                                                                                                                                                +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     if (this.total.isLessThanOrEqual(Money.zero()) && !this.status.isDraft()) {                                                                                                                                             +
       throw new Error(''Order total must be positive'')                                                                                                                                                                     +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // Internal entity - not exposed directly                                                                                                                                                                                   +
 class OrderLine {                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   private constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     public readonly productId: ProductId,                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     public readonly productName: string,                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     private quantity: number,                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     private price: Money                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   ) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     this.validate()                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     productId: ProductId,                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     productName: string,                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     quantity: number,                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     price: Money                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   ): OrderLine {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     return new OrderLine(productId, productName, quantity, price)                                                                                                                                                           +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   changeQuantity(newQuantity: number): void {                                                                                                                                                                               +
     this.quantity = newQuantity                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.validate()                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getSubtotal(): Money {                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     return this.price.multiply(this.quantity)                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private validate(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     if (this.quantity <= 0) {                                                                                                                                                                                               +
       throw new Error(''Quantity must be positive'')                                                                                                                                                                        +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Examples                                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Example 1: Shopping Cart Aggregate                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class ShoppingCart {                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
   private static readonly MAX_ITEMS = 50                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   private static readonly MAX_QUANTITY_PER_ITEM = 99                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     public readonly id: CartId,                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     private readonly customerId: CustomerId,                                                                                                                                                                                +
     private items: CartItem[],                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     private lastModified: Date                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(customerId: CustomerId): ShoppingCart {                                                                                                                                                                     +
     return new ShoppingCart(                                                                                                                                                                                                +
       CartId.create(),                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
       customerId,                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
       [],                                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
       new Date()                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   addItem(product: Product, quantity: number): void {                                                                                                                                                                       +
     if (this.items.length >= ShoppingCart.MAX_ITEMS) {                                                                                                                                                                      +
       throw new Error(''Cart is full'')                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     if (quantity > ShoppingCart.MAX_QUANTITY_PER_ITEM) {                                                                                                                                                                    +
       throw new Error(''Quantity exceeds maximum per item'')                                                                                                                                                                +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     const existingItem = this.findItem(product.id)                                                                                                                                                                          +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     if (existingItem) {                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
       const newQuantity = existingItem.quantity + quantity                                                                                                                                                                  +
       if (newQuantity > ShoppingCart.MAX_QUANTITY_PER_ITEM) {                                                                                                                                                               +
         throw new Error(''Total quantity exceeds maximum'')                                                                                                                                                                 +
       }                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
       existingItem.increaseQuantity(quantity)                                                                                                                                                                               +
     } else {                                                                                                                                                                                                                +
       this.items.push(CartItem.create(product, quantity))                                                                                                                                                                   +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.lastModified = new Date()                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   removeItem(productId: ProductId): void {                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     this.items = this.items.filter(                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       item => !item.productId.equals(productId)                                                                                                                                                                             +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     this.lastModified = new Date()                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   clear(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     this.items = []                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     this.lastModified = new Date()                                                                                                                                                                                          +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   checkout(): Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     if (this.items.length === 0) {                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       throw new Error(''Cannot checkout empty cart'')                                                                                                                                                                       +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     const orderLines = this.items.map(item =>                                                                                                                                                                               +
       OrderLine.create(                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
         item.productId,                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
         item.productName,                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
         item.quantity,                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
         item.price                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       )                                                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     return Order.create(this.customerId, orderLines)                                                                                                                                                                        +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private findItem(productId: ProductId): CartItem | undefined {                                                                                                                                                            +
     return this.items.find(item => item.productId.equals(productId))                                                                                                                                                        +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Example 2: Reservation Aggregate                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Reservation {                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
   private constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     public readonly id: ReservationId,                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     private readonly hotelId: HotelId,                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     private roomId: RoomId,                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     private guestId: GuestId,                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     private checkIn: Date,                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     private checkOut: Date,                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
     private numberOfGuests: number,                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     private status: ReservationStatus,                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     private specialRequests: string[]                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   ) {                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     this.validateInvariants()                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   static create(                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     hotelId: HotelId,                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     roomId: RoomId,                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     guestId: GuestId,                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     checkIn: Date,                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     checkOut: Date,                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     numberOfGuests: number                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   ): Reservation {                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     return new Reservation(                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
       ReservationId.create(),                                                                                                                                                                                               +
       hotelId,                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
       roomId,                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
       guestId,                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
       checkIn,                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
       checkOut,                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
       numberOfGuests,                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       ReservationStatus.Pending,                                                                                                                                                                                            +
       []                                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   confirm(room: Room): void {                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     if (!this.status.isPending()) {                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       throw new Error(''Can only confirm pending reservations'')                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     if (this.numberOfGuests > room.maxOccupancy) {                                                                                                                                                                          +
       throw new Error(''Exceeds room capacity'')                                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.status = ReservationStatus.Confirmed                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   changeDates(checkIn: Date, checkOut: Date): void {                                                                                                                                                                        +
     if (this.status.isCheckedIn() || this.status.isCompleted()) {                                                                                                                                                           +
       throw new Error(''Cannot change dates for active/completed reservations'')                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.checkIn = checkIn                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     this.checkOut = checkOut                                                                                                                                                                                                +
     this.validateInvariants()                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   changeGuests(numberOfGuests: number, room: Room): void {                                                                                                                                                                  +
     if (numberOfGuests > room.maxOccupancy) {                                                                                                                                                                               +
       throw new Error(''Exceeds room capacity'')                                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.numberOfGuests = numberOfGuests                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   addSpecialRequest(request: string): void {                                                                                                                                                                                +
     if (this.status.isCompleted() || this.status.isCancelled()) {                                                                                                                                                           +
       throw new Error(''Cannot add requests to completed/cancelled reservations'')                                                                                                                                          +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.specialRequests.push(request)                                                                                                                                                                                      +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   checkIn(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     if (!this.status.isConfirmed()) {                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       throw new Error(''Can only check in confirmed reservations'')                                                                                                                                                         +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.status = ReservationStatus.CheckedIn                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   checkOut(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     if (!this.status.isCheckedIn()) {                                                                                                                                                                                       +
       throw new Error(''Can only check out active reservations'')                                                                                                                                                           +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.status = ReservationStatus.Completed                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   cancel(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     if (this.status.isCompleted()) {                                                                                                                                                                                        +
       throw new Error(''Cannot cancel completed reservation'')                                                                                                                                                              +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     this.status = ReservationStatus.Cancelled                                                                                                                                                                               +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   private validateInvariants(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     if (this.checkIn >= this.checkOut) {                                                                                                                                                                                    +
       throw new Error(''Check-out must be after check-in'')                                                                                                                                                                 +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     if (this.numberOfGuests <= 0) {                                                                                                                                                                                         +
       throw new Error(''Must have at least one guest'')                                                                                                                                                                     +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
     const now = new Date()                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
     if (this.checkIn < now && this.status.isPending()) {                                                                                                                                                                    +
       throw new Error(''Check-in date cannot be in the past'')                                                                                                                                                              +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Best Practices                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 1. Design Small Aggregates                                                                                                                                                                                              +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 // ✅ Good: Small, focused aggregate                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   constructor(                                                                                                                                                                                                              +
     public readonly id: OrderId,                                                                                                                                                                                            +
     private customerId: CustomerId,  // Reference by ID                                                                                                                                                                     +
     private items: OrderLine[]                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   ) {}                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 // ❌ Bad: Large aggregate with nested entities                                                                                                                                                                             +
 class Customer {                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   orders: Order[]          // Should be separate                                                                                                                                                                            +
   addresses: Address[]     // Should be separate                                                                                                                                                                            +
   paymentMethods: PaymentMethod[]  // Should be separate                                                                                                                                                                    +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 2. Protect Invariants                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   private validateInvariants(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                      +
     if (this.items.length === 0) {                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       throw new Error(''Order must have items'')                                                                                                                                                                            +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
     if (this.total.isNegative()) {                                                                                                                                                                                          +
       throw new Error(''Total cannot be negative'')                                                                                                                                                                         +
     }                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   addItem(item: OrderLine): void {                                                                                                                                                                                          +
     this.items.push(item)                                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     this.validateInvariants()  // Check after every modification                                                                                                                                                            +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 3. Use Domain Events                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   private domainEvents: DomainEvent[] = []                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   confirm(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
     this.status = OrderStatus.Confirmed                                                                                                                                                                                     +
     this.domainEvents.push(                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
       new OrderConfirmedEvent(this.id, this.customerId, this.total)                                                                                                                                                         +
     )                                                                                                                                                                                                                       +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   getDomainEvents(): DomainEvent[] {                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     return [...this.domainEvents]                                                                                                                                                                                           +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   clearDomainEvents(): void {                                                                                                                                                                                               +
     this.domainEvents = []                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### 4. Control Modifications                                                                                                                                                                                                +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ```typescript                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 class Order {                                                                                                                                                                                                               +
   // ✅ Controlled modification through methods                                                                                                                                                                             +
   changeItemQuantity(productId: ProductId, quantity: number): void {                                                                                                                                                        +
     const item = this.findItem(productId)                                                                                                                                                                                   +
     item.changeQuantity(quantity)                                                                                                                                                                                           +
     this.recalculateTotal()                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ❌ Don''t expose internal collections                                                                                                                                                                                  +
   // getItems(): OrderLine[] {                                                                                                                                                                                              +
   //   return this.items                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
   // }                                                                                                                                                                                                                      +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
   // ✅ Provide read-only access                                                                                                                                                                                            +
   getItems(): readonly OrderLine[] {                                                                                                                                                                                        +
     return Object.freeze([...this.items])                                                                                                                                                                                   +
   }                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 }                                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 ```                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ---                                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ## Summary                                                                                                                                                                                                                  +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Key Takeaways                                                                                                                                                                                                           +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Aggregates are consistency boundaries**                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - Enforce business invariants                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 - One transaction per aggregate                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - Changes are atomic                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Aggregate roots control access**                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 - Single entry point                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
 - Protect internal entities                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
 - Coordinate changes                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **Design small aggregates**                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 - Prefer smaller over larger                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - Reference others by ID                                                                                                                                                                                                    +
 - Eventual consistency between aggregates                                                                                                                                                                                   +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ✅ **One repository per aggregate**                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - Persist as a unit                                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - Load as a unit                                                                                                                                                                                                            +
 - No repositories for internal entities                                                                                                                                                                                     +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 ### Design Checklist                                                                                                                                                                                                        +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
 - [ ] Identified true invariants?                                                                                                                                                                                           +
 - [ ] Aggregate small enough?                                                                                                                                                                                               +
 - [ ] Single responsibility?                                                                                                                                                                                                +
 - [ ] References others by ID?                                                                                                                                                                                              +
 - [ ] Can use eventual consistency?                                                                                                                                                                                         +
 - [ ] All modifications through root?                                                                                                                                                                                       +
 - [ ] Invariants protected?                                                                                                                                                                                                 +
                                                                                                                                                                                                                             +
